title: "From the Notebook to the Cluster: Workshop Materials for toolero, containr, and submitr"
authors:
  - family-names: Lares
    given-names: Erwin
    affiliation: "University of Wisconsin-Madison"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3284-828X"
